$T0> SECTOR 2; TEST
$T0> ##################################
$T0> AUTOCOMMIT OFF;
Set autocommit off success.
$T0> SELECT /*+ INDEX(NGM_QRY_LOCK, NGM_QRY_LOCK_I) */ P, K, V
      FROM NGM_QRY_LOCK
     WHERE K BETWEEN 'K-101' AND 'K-121'
     ORDER BY K
     FOR UPDATE;
